  "summary": {
    "es": "El cuarto match entre Kasparov y Karpov se jugó en Sevilla y fue parejo de principio a fin. Tras 22 partidas iban empatados; Karpov ganó la 23 y quedó a unas tablas del título. Kasparov ganó la 24, en una partida tensa y larga, empató 12–12 y conservó la corona.",
    "en": "The fourth Kasparov–Karpov match was played in Seville and was close from start to finish. After 22 games they were level; Karpov won game 23 and stood a draw away from the title. Kasparov won game 24, a long and tense game, tied 12–12 and kept the crown."
  },
